{"seq":36,"data":{"type":"RUN_FINISHED","threadId":"59b45f43-805d-443a-8e6e-fda2069b55c0","runId":"run_1_1788365932016","result":"The regex has been saved to `/app/regex.txt`. \n\nHere's how it works:\n\n- **`^(?=.*\\b..IPv4..\\b)`** — Starts at the beginning of a line and uses a positive lookahead to verify an IPv4 address exists somewhere on that line\n- **`.*\\b`** — Greedily matches characters up to a word boundary, which helps position us at a potential date\n- **`(...DATE...)`** — Capturing group matching the last valid date:\n  - Days 01-31 for months 01,03,05,07,08,10,12\n  - Days 01-30 for months 04,06,09,11  \n  - Days 01-29 for month 02 (February)\n- **`\\b(?!.*\\b..DATE..\\b)`** — Word boundary after the date with a negative lookahead ensuring no other valid date follows on the same line\n\nThe word boundaries prevent false matches like \"user 1134-12-1234\" (the day \"1234\" exceeds valid ranges, and the lookahead prevents matching within a longer number).","rawEvent":{"duration_api_ms":108003,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"59b45f43-805d-443a-8e6e-fda2069b55c0","total_cost_usd":0.11849585,"usage":{"input_tokens":17,"cache_creation_input_tokens":18699,"cache_read_input_tokens":26321,"output_tokens":18245,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":17166},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":18699},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":8,"output_tokens":564,"cache_read_input_tokens":13632,"cache_creation_input_tokens":17756,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":17756,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":1158,"outputTokens":18,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.001248,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"thinkingTokens":0,"canonicalModel